WEBVTT

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:11.330
Anne, listen to this! 
I'm advancing to the next grade!

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:13.820
I made it to the second year!

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:15.820
That is cause to celebrate.

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:16.900
Yeah!

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.800
Now Mother won't disown me!

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.800
Thank goodness!

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:24.880
I need to be careful, though.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:29.800
In the game, Catarina is judged 
for her evil deeds just before Nicol

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.970
and the other second-years 
have their graduation party,

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:35.180
and she meets her doom in the end...

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:38.660
Oh, sorry! I was talking to myself.

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:40.820
It's all right. I'm used to it.

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:44.110
I'm going to tell everyone else the news!

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:46.110
Goodbye, then.

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:50.770
Oh! I forgot to mention something!

00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:54.480
I made it to my second year 
because I had you!

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:55.320
Thank you!

00:00:56.890 --> 00:01:00.120
I... haven't done anything...

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:03.200
You've stayed by my side! That's what counts!

00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:33.320
<b>My Next Life as a Villainess:
All Routes Lead to Doom!</b>

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:56.190
<b>Episode 9 
Things Got Crazy at a Slumber Party...</b>

00:02:52.090 --> 00:02:53.820
Congratulations, Sister.

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:56.180
We must do something to celebrate!

00:02:57.700 --> 00:03:00.310
<i>Lady Catarina is terribly problematic,</i>

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:02.590
<i>but she's very popular 
within certain circles.</i>

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:06.030
<i>With Prince Geordo Stuart, for instance,</i>

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:10.820
<i>Lady Catarina is completely 
oblivious to his feelings.</i>

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:15.000
<i>She even suggested breaking 
off their engagement once.</i>

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:20.540
My wound has healed, so you don't have to take responsibility anymore.

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:23.750
You can break off the engagement.

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:27.380
The wound hasn't healed.

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:29.770
I will never break off our engagement.

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:32.440
What? But it should be healed...

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:35.510
I've checked in the mirror so many times.

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:37.730
Right, Anne?

00:03:39.390 --> 00:03:41.520
You were mistaken.

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:45.700
The scar is most definitely still there.

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:48.660
Well, don't you agree with me?

00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:58.160
<i>Frankly, that scared me so much, 
I think it shaved a few years off my life.</i>

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:03.590
You know, I'm hopeless with written exams,

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:06.190
<i>Master Keith secretly has 
feelings for Lady Catarina.</i>

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:06.900
but practical exams...

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:22.710
<i>But because Lady Catarina is so dense,</i>

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:25.360
<i>she has no idea how he feels.</i>

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:28.350
Oh, he's just too hot!

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:30.690
I can't bring myself to approach him!

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:36.950
I've been hearing 
that you're unbelievably hot.

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:39.080
You might end up 
with a girlfriend in no time.

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:44.570
It doesn't matter if people call me hot.

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:46.340
If the person I <i>want</i> to see it doesn't,

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:48.790
then what's the point?

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:51.740
<i>I truly had to pity him.</i>

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:56.090
My sister is not fit 
to be a prince's consort!

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:59.730
<b>Opposed!!</b>

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:59.730
<b>Catarina is not fit 
to be a prince's consort!!</b>

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:53.870
<i>And now,</i>

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:58.840
<i>he's doing everything in his power to break up 
Lady Catarina and Prince Geordo's engagement.</i>

00:04:56.090 --> 00:04:59.730
Catarina is not fit to be a prince's consort!

00:04:58.230 --> 00:04:59.730
Not fit!

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:04.510
<i>And Prince Alan Stuart's feelings 
toward Lady Catarina are also...</i>

00:05:05.890 --> 00:05:11.410
Why do I have to play 
for a bunch of poorly-raised potatoes?

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:14.270
I heard music is good for vegetables, too!

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:15.740
Please!

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:21.340
Oh, fine...

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:24.220
Thank you, Prince Alan!

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:29.970
<i>But sadly, Prince Alan still seems 
to be unaware of his own feelings.</i>

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:34.980
<i>Lady Mary Hunt also loves Lady Catarina.</i>

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:38.750
<i>In fact, she's concocted quite a terrifying plan.</i>

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:44.610
I'm not fit for a position so 
important as a prince's consort.

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:47.980
If you're unfit, then it's 
even more impossible for me.

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:49.950
I have no idea what I'm meant to do.

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:53.000
Then let's both cancel our engagements

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:55.080
and flee to somewhere far away!

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:58.790
It would be nice to live near the sea!

00:05:58.790 --> 00:05:59.890
Yes!

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:03.230
This island has boats departing 
for the city three times a day.

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:05.200
We wouldn't have any difficulty getting by!

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:08.190
You're such a nice girl, Mary.

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:10.300
<i>But because Lady Catarina is so dense,</i>

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:14.020
<i>she has no idea that Lady Mary 
is actually serious.</i>

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:20.230
<i>Master Nicol Ascart seems to have 
feelings for Lady Catarina, as well.</i>

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:25.520
<i>He very rarely speaks first to anyone 
or changes his expression,</i>

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:30.330
<i>but in front of Lady Catarina, 
even Master Nicol...</i>

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:33.340
<i>shows a smile that looks truly happy.</i>

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:39.560
<i>And Miss Sophia Ascart
also loves Lady Catarina.</i>

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:45.470
<i>Miss Sophia noticed how Master Nicol, 
her brother, felt before anyone else,</i>

00:06:45.470 --> 00:06:48.860
<i>and she's been trying her hardest 
to get Lady Catarina to realize it...</i>

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:52.440
My brother is just so kind!

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:54.890
My brother is just so brave!

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:57.890
My brother is just so adorable!

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:59.300
Adorable?

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:00.220
Yes!

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:03.900
You're really attached 
to your brother, aren't you?

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:07.100
<i>But unfortunately, the message 
isn't coming through at all.</i>

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:12.970
<i>And Miss Maria Campbell 
also loves Lady Catarina.</i>

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:16.860
Lady Catarina, please eat these.

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:19.580
Thank you!

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:30.660
<i>Which is why I say that,</i>

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:33.590
<i>within certain circles, 
Lady Catarina is very popular.</i>

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:37.890
<i>What is it about Lady Catarina 
that draws people to her so?</i>

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:46.700
<i>In truth, I know the answer to that.</i>

00:07:48.970 --> 00:07:51.230
Then we'll see you again this evening.

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:53.200
Yes, I look forward to it.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:54.830
Is something happening this evening?

00:07:55.060 --> 00:07:57.720
We're all having pajama party.

00:07:57.720 --> 00:07:59.850
All of you? A pajama party?

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:02.490
What exactly do you do at a pajama party?

00:08:02.570 --> 00:08:04.590
We all get together in our pajamas,

00:08:04.590 --> 00:08:08.460
and spend time chatting 
and eating delicious snacks together.

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:10.920
That sounds delightful.

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.720
Oh, I know!

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:14.970
Why don't you boys have a boys-only party?

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:18.000
What are you talking about, Sister?

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:20.370
That's never going to happen.

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:22.980
Aw, Keith, why not?

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:24.930
A boys-only party would be lovely!

00:08:24.930 --> 00:08:27.950
You can spend the whole 
night talking about boy stuff!

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:30.380
No, that wouldn't be the least bit lovely.

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:34.340
I don't even know what 
we'd talk about all night.

00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:37.320
Would you not agree, Master Nicol?

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:40.830
The whole night... talking about boy stuff?

00:08:41.010 --> 00:08:43.450
Wait, are you serious, Master Nicol?

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:44.640
I think it sounds fun.

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:45.840
What?!

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:47.380
You, too, Prince Alan?!

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:48.620
We still have time.

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:50.210
Wait, you two...

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:54.530
<i>Just the boys... talking all night?</i>

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:05.230
Lady Catarina! What is all this?

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:08.310
They're my pajamas for the party tonight.

00:09:08.970 --> 00:09:11.450
I can't decide which ones to wear.

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:15.070
I'm thinking of wearing these. 
What do you think?

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:22.160
You look lovely, but aren't 
there any other options?

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.940
Really?

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:25.550
Then...

00:09:29.760 --> 00:09:33.000
How about these? They light up in the dark!

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:41.280
I think, perhaps, something 
a bit more subdued...

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:43.690
Aw!

00:09:45.970 --> 00:09:49.180
It's not a girls-only party 
without love talk!

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:52.240
Does anyone here have a sweetheart?

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:58.210
Yeah, I guess none of us do...

00:09:58.670 --> 00:09:59.800
<i>All right!</i>

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:03.700
<i>There's still no relationship progress between 
Maria and the conquerable characters!</i>

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:07.630
<i>Which means there can't be any 
doom flags triggered yet!</i>

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:12.920
That reminded me that there's 
something I wanted to ask all of you.

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:16.970
If you were seeing someone, 
what would you want to do with them?

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:17.760
Huh?

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:19.890
I'm not sure...

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:23.010
Lady Catarina, please give us your answer!

00:10:23.070 --> 00:10:26.420
Um, let me think...

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:32.240
I guess I'd want to make them a meal 
from the vegetables I raised.

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:38.400
Okay, next! What about you, Maria?

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:41.240
Um... I...

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:45.180
I'd want to make sweets for them.

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:47.650
I'm learning how to cook, too,

00:10:47.650 --> 00:10:50.160
so when I get good at it, 
I'd want to cook for them.

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:53.700
Your cooking would be amazing, Maria!

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:54.890
I want to taste-test it!

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:56.460
Yes, of course!

00:10:56.690 --> 00:10:58.240
What about you, Lady Mary?

00:10:58.240 --> 00:11:02.480
I'd want to eat meals 
with them, bathe with them...

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:05.450
B-Bathe?

00:11:05.450 --> 00:11:07.340
And we could comb each other's hair...

00:11:07.340 --> 00:11:10.960
Oh, and we could style each other's hair...

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:12.850
And we could trade dresses!

00:11:13.010 --> 00:11:13.940
Huh?

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:17.330
You wouldn't trade dresses 
with a boy, would you?

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:20.790
What? Does the partner have to be a boy?

00:11:20.790 --> 00:11:23.330
Well, I just assumed it would be...

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:24.610
Huh?

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:27.120
In that case, I can't think of anything.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:30.940
I'm happier when 
I'm with you, Lady Catarina.

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:34.080
All right, Miss Sophia, you're last.

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:37.360
My wishes are all ordinary things.

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:40.170
Like visiting bookstores together...

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:41.090
Uh-huh!

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:45.540
And fighting together 
for the good of our country,

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:48.720
freeing their heart from 
the darkness lurking within it,

00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:52.490
undoing the curse placed 
on them by an evil witch,

00:11:52.490 --> 00:11:56.590
searching for the legendary ring so 
we can explore the world of the gods,

00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:55.070
These are ordinary?

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:59.870
singing for the people 
who are fighting for a revolution...

00:11:56.990 --> 00:12:00.820
Um, Lady Catarina, is this...

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:02.520
Even though they were abducted as a child

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:04.560
Yeah... This all happened 
in a romance novel.

00:12:02.520 --> 00:12:05.440
and taken in by a 
family of traveling performers...

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:07.660
I borrowed it from her 
and read it a while ago.

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:12.690
By the way, Anne, has there been 
any talk of marriage for you?

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:15.820
Perhaps it's already been 
decided who your partner will be?

00:12:15.820 --> 00:12:17.580
Really? What are they like?

00:12:17.660 --> 00:12:19.360
Please tell us!

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:22.530
There is no such person.

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:26.970
I have no desire to get married, anyway.

00:12:27.090 --> 00:12:28.040
What?

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:29.370
You don't?

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:30.720
Why not?

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:33.780
Well...

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:41.130
I know!

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:43.740
I have a question for all of you, too!

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:46.850
If you could be reborn, 
what would you want to be?

00:12:46.850 --> 00:12:48.350
Reborn?!

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:51.240
That happens in lots of romance novels, too!

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:55.300
I'd want to be a princess 
in a forbidden relationship with a knight!

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:58.360
Maybe a female knight who dresses as a man,

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:59.100
I'd have to say a man of higher 
status than Prince Geordo.

00:12:58.360 --> 00:13:01.040
or a nun who's fled from her convent,

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:02.180
Let's see... I think...

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:03.250
or a fairy who falls in love with a human,

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:05.380
or a legendary holy sword...

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:07.060
Anne, it's late. Go get some rest.

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:10.020
Very well. I will take my leave, then.

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:11.850
Goodnight.

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:14.060
Goodnight!

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:25.020
<i>I was born to Baron Shelley 
and one of his maids.</i>

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:28.970
<i>I did exactly as my mother wished,</i>

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:32.540
<i>behaving meekly and submissively 
so that the baron would like me.</i>

00:13:33.320 --> 00:13:35.910
<i>I was convinced 
that I was happy with that life.</i>

00:13:37.070 --> 00:13:38.000
<i>However...</i>

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:42.960
<i>When I was fifteen years old,</i>

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:45.250
<i>my mother died in a fire.</i>

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:53.720
With that scar,

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:56.600
you're of no use to me 
as a political marriage pawn.

00:13:56.930 --> 00:13:59.860
I have no further need of you. 
Leave this house.

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:06.250
<i>The baron never had any 
interest in me at all.</i>

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:09.220
<i>I was only a tool...</i>

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:12.400
<i>someone he didn't need anymore.</i>

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:20.230
<i>Then I took a job as a maid in the home 
of Duke Claes, a distant relative.</i>

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:23.760
<i>Lady Catarina was a pampered child,</i>

00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:25.640
<i>making her very selfish and arrogant.</i>

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:29.940
<i>I only tried to be 
a useful tool for my master,</i>

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:32.020
<i>as I had been to the baron.</i>

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:36.000
<i>I remained meek and submissive, 
with no will of my own.</i>

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:42.210
<i>But after the events of one day, 
Lady Catarina changed.</i>

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:46.060
<i>She was far from the typical well-bred lady.</i>

00:14:46.850 --> 00:14:49.450
<i>I had no idea how I should interact with her,</i>

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:54.910
<i>but before I knew it, I had learned 
to act of my own will and speak my own mind.</i>

00:14:56.480 --> 00:15:01.540
<i>Around Lady Catarina, who was cheerful, 
energetic, and treated everyone equally,</i>

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:06.370
<i>I could no longer be just a tool.</i>

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:20.280
<i>The first birthday 
present I ever received...</i>

00:15:24.130 --> 00:15:28.980
<i>Lady Catarina accepted 
and loved me for who I was.</i>

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:33.400
<i>Then, just when I began to wish</i>

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:37.110
<i>that I could spend 
the rest of my life here...</i>

00:15:45.810 --> 00:15:48.360
<i>Your wedding date has been set.</i>

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:50.990
<i>I will be sending for you. Be ready.</i>

00:15:55.660 --> 00:15:59.400
I found you a partner who's 
benevolent enough to take you,

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:02.400
even though you're damaged goods.

00:16:04.970 --> 00:16:08.430
Why are you still standing there?! 
Get ready at once!

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:15.880
You're Anne's father, yes?

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:18.990
My name is Catarina Claes.

00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:20.820
Y-Yes...

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:22.990
I have a favor to ask.

00:16:22.990 --> 00:16:25.880
Please reconsider making Anne get married!

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:30.140
I need Anne!

00:16:30.140 --> 00:16:32.010
I want her by my side!

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:34.160
You can't take her from me!

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:39.220
Let me tell you just how important 
and necessary Anne is to me!

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:40.530
First, in the mornings,

00:16:40.530 --> 00:16:43.820
she always wakes me up when I sleep too late

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:45.440
and fixes my hair for me!

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:48.450
No, wait! I need to go back ever further!

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:54.530
Um... I'm a restless sleeper, 
so I always kick my blanket off,

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:56.760
but Anne always gets up 
at least once per night

00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:58.860
to fix my blanket for me!

00:16:59.020 --> 00:17:01.240
Please let Anne stay with me!

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:02.370
Please!

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:10.840
I would like...

00:17:12.140 --> 00:17:13.970
to decline this marriage offer.

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:14.930
What?!

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:18.170
I will not be ordered around by you, Father.

00:17:18.170 --> 00:17:20.680
What did you say?! Watch your tongue!

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:27.340
Pardon me.

00:17:29.300 --> 00:17:30.270
Baron...

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:34.100
I would like to speak with you for a moment.

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:58.650
<i>Lady Catarina made me 
into the person named Anne Shelley.</i>

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:06.860
<i>I will follow her wherever she goes.</i>

00:18:07.930 --> 00:18:12.900
<i>By Lady Catarina's side 
is where I am truly happy.</i>

00:18:23.640 --> 00:18:24.870
Prince Geordo.

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:27.200
A letter has arrived for you.

00:18:27.340 --> 00:18:28.730
It's from Catarina?

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:31.450
How unusual for her 
to take the trouble to write.

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:34.640
<i>Dear Prince Geordo Stuart...</i>

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:37.620
<i>Please come to the terrace 
in the garden behind the school.</i>

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:39.420
<i>I'll be waiting for you.</i>

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:41.140
<i>Catarina Claes.</i>

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:46.280
<i>The normal Catarina wouldn't choose 
such an elegant, showy card...</i>

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:49.570
<i>And asking me to come 
to a place that's usually deserted...</i>

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:51.520
<i>Could this be...</i>

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:54.000
Prince Geordo...

00:18:54.660 --> 00:18:58.380
I've finally realized how I feel.

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:00.450
You are the one I...

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:04.450
<i>No, wait. Calm down.</i>

00:19:05.150 --> 00:19:06.880
<i>This is Catarina we're talking about.</i>

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:08.980
<i>It couldn't be something that amorous.</i>

00:19:08.980 --> 00:19:11.340
<i>It must be something else.</i>

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:11.630
It's the latest model of toy snake!

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:17.580
<i>Still, as her fiancé, 
I can't decline this invitation.</i>

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:20.920
<i>Maybe I should prepare a gift to give her.</i>

00:19:21.810 --> 00:19:23.120
<i>Considering the occasion,</i>

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:26.230
<i>it should be the thing 
that would make her happiest...</i>

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:32.810
The shears I always use haven't 
been cutting as well, as of late.

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:37.710
<i>Gardening shears...</i>

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:39.540
<i>But...</i>

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:44.820
<i>That couldn't possibly be any less romantic.</i>

00:19:45.090 --> 00:19:50.170
<i>It doesn't seem like a gift 
that a prince should give his fiancée.</i>

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:54.170
<i>Still, I have confidence</i>

00:19:54.720 --> 00:19:58.130
<i>that she'll like it far more than any</i>

00:19:58.520 --> 00:20:00.560
<i>gaudy, extravagant ornament.</i>

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:05.360
<i>I haven't been watching her from right 
by her side all these years for nothing.</i>

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:10.650
Since that's settled, 
I must arrange her gift right away!

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:14.490
I'll have it engraved with her name, 
put it in a fine case, and...

00:20:14.490 --> 00:20:16.560
What's gotten into Prince Geordo?

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:19.660
How unusual. He's absolutely giddy.

00:20:28.800 --> 00:20:30.260
Prince Geordo...

00:20:30.740 --> 00:20:34.040
What are all of you doing here?

00:20:35.800 --> 00:20:39.460
You sent them to everyone, Catarina?!

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:41.670
Hey!

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:44.190
Thanks for coming, everyone!

00:20:44.190 --> 00:20:47.140
Welcome to my harvest day!

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:48.770
Harvest day?

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:50.640
<b>Geordo</b>

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:51.970
I had work outfits made for all of you!

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:53.730
<b>Geordo</b>

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:53.730
<b>Maria</b>

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:53.730
<b>Mary</b>

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:53.730
<b>Alan</b>

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:53.730
<b>Nicol</b>

00:20:51.970 --> 00:20:53.460
Please use them!

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:56.510
That's what this is about?

00:21:01.720 --> 00:21:03.630
Everyone!

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:05.880
You look fantastic!

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:07.130
Catarina.

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:09.760
This is for you.

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:11.410
Please use it if you like.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:18.890
Thank you, Prince Geordo!

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:20.670
You're welcome.

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:24.020
I'm happy just to see you smile like th—

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:28.640
Everyone, thank you 
for all the beautiful shears!

00:21:36.930 --> 00:21:40.330
Well... I suppose I should 
have seen this coming...

00:23:11.580 --> 00:23:13.360
<i>The seasons have passed,</i>

00:23:13.360 --> 00:23:16.160
<i>and autumn is now giving way to winter.</i>

00:23:16.620 --> 00:23:20.430
<i>It appears I've avoided setting any 
of my doom flags thus far.</i>

00:23:24.810 --> 00:23:27.130
<i>And then it happened out of nowhere...</i>

00:23:27.910 --> 00:23:29.740
Catarina Claes,

00:23:29.740 --> 00:23:35.270
we are going to expose all of the evil 
deeds you have committed, here and now!

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:39.290
Evil deeds? Me?
